error[E0277]: `zeroship_core::config::Secret<std::string::String>` doesn't implement `std::fmt::Display`
 --> tests/ui/secret_cannot_be_displayed.rs
  |
  |     println!("{}", Secret::new(String::from("supersecretpw")));
  |               --   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `zeroship_core::config::Secret<std::string::String>` cannot be formatted with the default formatter
  |               |
  |               required by this formatting parameter
  |
  = help: the trait `std::fmt::Display` is not implemented for `zeroship_core::config::Secret<std::string::String>`
  = note: in format strings you may be able to use `{:?}` (or {:#?} for pretty-print) instead
  = note: this error originates in the macro `$crate::format_args_nl` which comes from the expansion of the macro `println` (in Nightly builds, run with -Z macro-backtrace for more info)
